  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **My Favorite Things** (1 review): Reviewer requested this song; John remarked that people mostly know it from bootlegs. Uploader's track label for it was wrong [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Rotten Stinking Mouthpiec**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Family Happiness**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **My Favorite Things**: back after 52 archived shows (1588 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Bad Priestess**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Outer Scorpion Squadro**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Age of Kings**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2011-04-08.mix.flac.16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 97 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Cat's Cradle was packed, hot and loud, and the reviewer found the whole night's atmosphere breathtaking [2]\n- Megafaun also played at this show, and the reviewer says they did very well [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2011-04-08.mix.flac.16**: taped by Larry Tucker; transferred by Larry Tucker; source: PelusoCEMC6-CK21 > FR2@-LE + SBD > R09-HR [1]",
